When you loaded the optional subsets during the advanced installation process you
should have loaded all the subsets containing the words reference pages for.
(these are the man pages)

To go back and do it now:

1) su to root

2) mount the DEC UNIX v3.2 cd (mount -r /dev/rz?c /mnt)

3) set the load device to the proper directory (setld -l /mnt/ALPHA/BASE)

4) select the reference page subsets

5) follow instructions

Have fun.

