experiencing response-time problems between them and a DigitalUNIX
machine - problems that did not exist with Ultrix 4.3.  Any assistance
would be greatly appreciated.

Our setup (3 machines):

  a:  DigitalUNIX 3.2c on an AlphaStation 200 4/166
         - NFS mounting disks from b
         - NIS exporting account info to b and c
         - BIND master server

  b:  Ultrix 4.5 on a DECstation 5000/200
         - NFS exporting disks to b and c
         - NIS loading account info from a
         - BIND slave server

  c:  Ultrix 4.5 on a DECstation 3100
         - NFS mounting disks from b
         - NIS loading account info from a
         - BIND client

