Hi

We had the same problem some time ago. The problem is the enhanced 
security system. Our solution was:

1) Boot the computer in single user mode.
2) Call the setup.
3) Switch off the enhanced security system.
4) Boot the computer again.

After that you can login as root with your old password. Don't ask me 
what has happened when ou switched on the enhanced security system, I 
really don't know and I never tried it again.

Hope this helps

