There is a product called 'StorageWorks Desktop Backup' (previous name
was 'PathWorks Desktop Backup'). It is a server software that needs to
be installed on your system and includes clients for MS-DOS, MS-Windows,
Mac (and newer versions also MS-Windows-NT I think). The version I have
supports DECnet and AppleTalk as the transport (and newer versions also
TCP/IP I think).

I run the server software on OpenVMS and use it with MS-Windows clients.
It runs quite fast.

