for bridging STREAMS device drivers to sockets. Such a facility is
available on DIGITAL UNIX (any version above 2.0) running on DEC 2100 
server.  The problem that I am having is that after pushing the "ifnet" 
streams module on top of my STREAMS Device Driver, I can't tell the 
"ifnet" module of the "unit number" of my Device Driver. The source code 
that I have used to do this is given below.

