>
>i am getting this message on the console
> OSF-BASE PAK is outdated
>
>what does that mean?

It probably means that your OSF/1 license has expired. This is no big problem, 
but I think that OSF/1 uses this license to limit the number of logged on 
non-root users (root can always log on). Use command 'lmf list' or 'lmf list 
full' to check if the license still is activated.

Marek Pola





